# Derived by hand from ruling TC and Semantics ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent): the button is 0, levels 3 down to 1 take places 1 to 3, the last clause's label 4, the caller's label 5; the click gives each level its own number through `!Fired`, and the last clause counts it. Never run.
test three_levels_hand_the_event_on

